  "markdown": "![EMPTY ALT](/logo.jpg)\n\n[link] [Afyawise](/)\n\n[link] [Home](/)\n\n[link] [Blog](/blog)\n\n[link] [Shop](/shop)\n\n[link] [Support Us](/support)\n\n[link] [About us](/about)\n\n[link] [Our Work](/work)\n\n[link] [Services](/services)\n\n[link] [Our Impact](/our-impact)\n\n[link] [Our Team](/team)\n\n[link] [Contact Us](/contact)\n\n# Make a Difference Today\n\nYour donation helps us bring sustainable health to Kenyan communities\n\n## Available Payment Methods\n\n![EMPTY ALT](/Icons/mobile-phone.svg)\n\n#### M-Pesa Till\n\nCOMING SOON\n\n![EMPTY ALT](/Icons/bank.svg)\n\n#### Bank Transfer\n\nBank: KCB\n\nAccount: AfyaWise\n\nNumber: 1343270596\n\nBranch: Maua\n\n![EMPTY ALT](/Icons/paypal.svg)\n\n#### PayPal\n\nCOMING SOON\n\n## What Your Donation Supports\n\n![EMPTY ALT](/Icons/scholar.svg)\n\n#### Train 100+ CHVs\n\nCommunity Health Volunteers bringing care to remote areas\n\n![EMPTY ALT](/Icons/mobile.svg)\n\n#### Mobile Health Clinics\n\nReaching underserved communities with essential healthcare\n\n![EMPTY ALT](/Icons/brain.svg)\n\n#### Mental Health Awareness\n\nBreaking stigma and providing mental health support\n\n![EMPTY ALT](/Icons/water-drop.svg)\n\n#### Safe Water Access\n\nClean water initiatives for healthier communities\n\n## Your Donation Transforms Lives\n\nJoin us in building healthier communities across Kenya. Every contribution makes a difference.\n\n![Afyawise logo](/logo.jpg)\n\n# Afyawise\n\nPromoting community health and well-being\n\n## Quick Links\n\n- Home  _(links: Home -> /)_\n\n- About  _(links: About -> /about)_\n\n- Our Team  _(links: Our Team -> /team)_\n\n- Our Work  _(links: Our Work -> /work)_\n\n### CONTACT\n\n![Email](Icons/email-white.svg)\n\n[link] [info@afyawise.org](mailto:info@afyawise.org)\n\n![Phone](Icons/phone-color.svg)\n\n[link] [+254798724766](tel:+254798724766)\n\n![Location](Icons/location-color.svg)\n\nKarama Ward, Meru County, Kenya\n\n© 2025 AfyaWise CBO. All rights reserved.",
  "innerText": "Afyawise\nHome\nBlog\nShop\nSupport Us\nAbout us\nOur Work\nServices\nOur Impact\nOur Team\nContact Us\nMake a Difference Today\n\nYour donation helps us bring sustainable health to Kenyan communities\n\nAvailable Payment Methods\nM-Pesa Till\n\nCOMING SOON\n\nBank Transfer\n\nBank: KCB\n\nAccount: AfyaWise\n\nNumber: 1343270596\n\nBranch: Maua\n\nPayPal\n\nCOMING SOON\n\nWhat Your Donation Supports\nTrain 100+ CHVs\n\nCommunity Health Volunteers bringing care to remote areas\n\nMobile Health Clinics\n\nReaching underserved communities with essential healthcare\n\nMental Health Awareness\n\nBreaking stigma and providing mental health support\n\nSafe Water Access\n\nClean water initiatives for healthier communities\n\nYour Donation Transforms Lives\n\nJoin us in building healthier communities across Kenya. Every contribution makes a difference.\n\nAfyawise\n\nPromoting community health and well-being\n\nQuick Links\nHome\nAbout\nOur Team\nOur Work\nCONTACT\ninfo@afyawise.org\n+254798724766\nKarama Ward, Meru County, Kenya\n\n© 2025 AfyaWise CBO.\nAll rights reserved.",
